#: data/text/questionnaire.inc:1
msgctxt "Questionnaire_Text_FillOut"
msgid ""
"There is a questionnaire.\n"
"Would you like to fill it out?$"
msgstr ""
"这里有一份问卷。\n"
"要填写吗？$"

#: data/text/questionnaire.inc:5
msgctxt "Questionnaire_Text_ThankYou"
msgid ""
"Thank you for taking the time to\n"
"fill out our questionnaire.\p"
"Your feedback will be used for\n"
"future reference.$"
msgstr ""
"感谢你抽出时间\n"
"填写我们的问卷。\p"
"你的意见\n"
"将作为今后的参考。$"

#: data/text/questionnaire.inc:11
msgctxt "Questionnaire_Text_YouKnowThoseWordsGift"
msgid ""
"Oh, hello!\n"
"You know those words?\p"
"That means you must know about\n"
"the MYSTERY GIFT.\p"
"From now on, you should be\n"
"receiving MYSTERY GIFTS!$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，你好！\n"
"你知道那句话吗？\p"
"这说明你一定知道\n"
"神秘礼物。\p"
"从现在开始，\n"
"你就可以接收神秘礼物了！$"

#: data/text/questionnaire.inc:19
msgctxt "Questionnaire_Text_YouCanAccessMysteryGift"
msgid ""
"Once you save your game, you can\n"
"access the MYSTERY GIFT.$"
msgstr ""
"记录游戏后，\n"
"就可以使用神秘礼物了。$"

#: data/text/questionnaire.inc:23
msgctxt "Questionnaire_Text_YouKnowThoseWordsEvent"
msgid ""
"Oh, hello!\n"
"You know those words?\p"
"That means you must know about\n"
"the MYSTERY EVENT.$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，你好！\n"
"你知道那句话吗？\p"
"这说明你一定知道\n"
"神秘活动。$"

#: data/text/questionnaire.inc:29
msgctxt "Questionnaire_Text_YouCanAccessMysteryEvent"
msgid ""
"Once you save your game, you can\n"
"access the MYSTERY EVENT.$"
msgstr ""
"记录游戏后，\n"
"就可以使用神秘活动了。$"

#: data/text/questionnaire.inc:33
msgctxt "MysteryGift_Text_TheresATicketForYou"
msgid ""
"Thank you for using the MYSTERY\n"
"EVENT System.\p"
"You must be {PLAYER}.\n"
"There is a ticket here for you.$"
msgstr ""
"感谢你使用神秘活动系统。\p"
"你就是{PLAYER}吧。\n"
"这里有一张给你的船票。$"

#: data/text/questionnaire.inc:39
msgctxt "MysteryGift_Text_TryUsingItAtLilycovePort"
msgid ""
"It appears to be for use at\n"
"the LILYCOVE CITY port.\p"
"Why not give it a try and see what\n"
"it is about?$"
msgstr ""
"这好像是在\n"
"水静市港口使用的。\p"
"要不要去试试看，\n"
"看看会发生什么？$"
